-| CEFR level | Cambridge exam |
-|---|---|
-| A2 | A2 Key (KET) |
-| B1 | B1 Preliminary (PET) |
-| B2 | B2 First (FCE) |
-| C1 | C1 Advanced (CAE) |
-| C2 | C2 Proficiency (CPE) |
