-Five decorative fonts (Playfair Display, Oswald, Bebas Neue, Special Elite, Courier Prime) are available for PDF/DOCX exports via the rubric's **Format** tab, with a live preview. All fonts are bundled with the app, so no page or print calls out to Google Fonts. A **dyslexia-friendly reading mode** and light/dark themes round out the appearance options.
-
-**Language:** English, Dutch, French, German or Spanish, or **Automatic** to follow the browser language. Students have the same picker in the portal header.
-
 ![Settings → General with language, theme, and Cambridge labels](images/settings-general.png)
 
 *Settings → General (language, theme, Cambridge labels).*
 
