-
-Rubric Maker targets **WCAG 2.1 AAA** contrast where physically possible (button/large-text contrast uses the 4.5:1 bar; link/body text targets 7:1). `src/utils/contrastCheck.ts` audits every theme bundle, accent preset, and CEFR badge color in the unit tests.
