-- **Screen readers:** drag handles and proctoring flags carry translatable `aria-label`s, the page `lang` follows the chosen interface language, and English test/essay content is marked as English so it is read with the right voice.
-- **Reading support:** a dyslexia-friendly display mode, **Read aloud** buttons on every piece of teacher feedback in the portal and on shared feedback links (browser voice, works offline), and a per-student read-aloud accommodation for tests.
