+# Audio-response
+
+> Students record a spoken answer in the browser.
+
+[← All question types](Question-Types) · [Tests & Practice](Tests-and-Practice)
+
+## Best for
+
+Speaking tasks and oral prompts.
+
+## How to build it
+
+- Set a recording cap. Optional **preparation time** with a visible cue card; recording starts automatically afterwards.
+- Optionally attach a rubric to score it per criterion.
+
+## How it is scored
+
+Manual. You play the recording back and grade it, with a rubric if attached.
+
+## Watch out for
+
+- Needs microphone permission. For fuller oral assessment, use [Speaking Sessions](Features#speaking-sessions).
+
+## Open research question
+
+*Reliability of speaking assessment and rater training.* — tracked in the [Research Agenda](Research-Agenda).
