+# Categorize
+
+> Sort items into categories.
+
+[← All question types](Question-Types) · [Tests & Practice](Tests-and-Practice)
+
+## Best for
+
+Parts of speech, countries by region, fact vs. opinion.
+
+## How to build it
+
+- Define the categories and assign each item to its category.
+
+## How it is scored
+
+Automatic; each correctly placed item is a share of the points.
+
+## Watch out for
+
+- Ambiguous items (that fit two categories) will cause unfair marking — pre-test them.
+
+## Open research question
+
+*Item ambiguity and fairness.* — tracked in the [Research Agenda](Research-Agenda).
