+# Word-bank fill-in
+
+> Drag word or sentence tiles from a bank into gaps.
+
+[← All question types](Question-Types) · [Tests & Practice](Tests-and-Practice)
+
+## Best for
+
+A1–B1 word boxes and FCE Part 6 gapped texts.
+
+## How to build it
+
+- Write the gaps, then add the tiles. Add extra **distractor** tiles. Each tile is used once by default.
+- Students drag tiles, or select a tile then click a gap (keyboard-friendly).
+
+## How it is scored
+
+Automatic, per gap, with partial credit.
+
+## Watch out for
+
+- Distractor tiles keep it from becoming pure elimination.
+
+## Open research question
+
+*How many distractors keep a word-bank task discriminating.* — tracked in the [Research Agenda](Research-Agenda).
