+# Hot text
+
+> Click the right fragments inside a passage.
+
+[← All question types](Question-Types) · [Tests & Practice](Tests-and-Practice)
+
+## Best for
+
+Finding evidence, identifying parts of speech or errors in a text.
+
+## How to build it
+
+- Mark clickable fragments with `[[…]]` and mark which ones are correct.
+
+## How it is scored
+
+Automatic. With partial credit on, the score is the share of fragments judged correctly — selected when they should be, and left alone when they should be.
+
+## Watch out for
+
+- As with multiple-response, leaving a wrong fragment alone earns credit, so an empty answer is not zero.
+
+## Open research question
+
+*Same partial-credit question as multiple-response.* — tracked in the [Research Agenda](Research-Agenda).
