+# Grid (matrix)
+
+> Several statements that share the same answer columns.
+
+[← All question types](Question-Types) · [Tests & Practice](Tests-and-Practice)
+
+## Best for
+
+True / False / Not given, A / B / C, or FCE Part 7 matching.
+
+## How to build it
+
+- Define the shared columns, then add the statements and pick the correct column for each.
+
+## How it is scored
+
+Automatic. Each statement is scored separately; partial credit supported.
+
+## Watch out for
+
+- More efficient than many separate items when the answer options are the same.
+
+## Open research question
+
+*Whether row-level scoring inflates scores through elimination.* — tracked in the [Research Agenda](Research-Agenda).
