+# Numeric
+
+> A number typed by the student.
+
+[← All question types](Question-Types) · [Tests & Practice](Tests-and-Practice)
+
+## Best for
+
+Maths and science, dates, quantities.
+
+## How to build it
+
+- Enter the expected value and a **tolerance** range (± value).
+
+## How it is scored
+
+Automatic. Full points when the answer is within ± the tolerance. An empty answer is zero; a response like `3,5` that is not a plain number is flagged for a human.
+
+## Watch out for
+
+- Decimal commas are not parsed as numbers automatically.
+
+## Open research question
+
+*Handling of decimal separators and units for Dutch-language classes.* — tracked in the [Research Agenda](Research-Agenda).
