+# Open (essay)
+
+> A free-text answer that you grade yourself.
+
+[← All question types](Question-Types) · [Tests & Practice](Tests-and-Practice)
+
+## Best for
+
+Writing tasks, explanations, anything that needs judgement.
+
+## How to build it
