+
+## Watch out for
+
+- A teacher-only **Writing insights** panel shows word count, CEFR vocabulary profile and grammar profile. It never suggests a score.
+
+## Open research question
+
+*Inter-rater reliability for rubric-scored writing.* — tracked in the [Research Agenda](Research-Agenda).
