+# Ordering
+
+> Drag items into the right sequence.
+
+[← All question types](Question-Types) · [Tests & Practice](Tests-and-Practice)
+
+## Best for
+
+Process steps, chronology, paragraph order.
+
+## How to build it
+
+- Add the items in the correct order; students see them shuffled. Optional images/hints.
+
+## How it is scored
+
