+# True / False
+
+> Decide whether a statement is true or false.
+
+[← All question types](Question-Types) · [Tests & Practice](Tests-and-Practice)
+
+## Best for
+
+Fast fact checks and reading comprehension (True / False / Not given is available as a Grid question).
+
+## How to build it
